flowchart TD

    %% Nodes
    StartPoint(使用者進入註冊頁面)
    EndPoint(使用者完成註冊)
    UserKeyInName(使用者輸入姓名)
    CheckNameFormat{檢查姓名格式}
    DisplayNameFormatError(顯示姓名格式錯誤訊息)
    UserKeyInEmail(使用者輸入 Email)
    CheckEmailFormat{檢查 Email 格式}
    DisplayEmailFormatError(顯示 Email 格式錯誤訊息)
    UserKeyInPassword(使用者輸入密碼)
    DisplayPasswordFormatError(顯示密碼格式錯誤訊息)
    CheckPasswordFormat{檢查密碼格式}
    UserKeyInPasswordConfirmation(使用者輸入確認密碼)
    CheckPasswordMatch{檢查密碼是否一致}
    DisplayPasswordMismatchError(顯示密碼不一致錯誤訊息)
    SubmitRegistration(提交註冊資訊)
    PasswordAndConfirmationHashed(密碼與確認密碼雜湊處理)
    CheckRegistrationResult(檢查註冊結果)
    ToLoginPage(導向登入頁面)
    DisplayRegistrationFailure(顯示註冊失敗訊息)

    %% Flow
    StartPoint --> UserKeyInName
    UserKeyInName --> CheckNameFormat
    CheckNameFormat -->|格式正確| UserKeyInEmail
    CheckNameFormat -->|格式錯誤| DisplayNameFormatError
    UserKeyInEmail --> CheckEmailFormat
    CheckEmailFormat -->|格式正確| UserKeyInPassword
    CheckEmailFormat -->|格式錯誤| DisplayEmailFormatError
    UserKeyInPassword --> CheckPasswordFormat
    CheckPasswordFormat -->|格式正確| UserKeyInPasswordConfirmation
    CheckPasswordFormat -->|格式錯誤| DisplayPasswordFormatError
    UserKeyInPasswordConfirmation --> CheckPasswordMatch
    CheckPasswordMatch -->|一致| PasswordAndConfirmationHashed
    PasswordAndConfirmationHashed --> SubmitRegistration
    CheckPasswordMatch -->|不一致| DisplayPasswordMismatchError
    SubmitRegistration --> CheckRegistrationResult
    CheckRegistrationResult -->|成功| ToLoginPage
    CheckRegistrationResult -->|失敗| DisplayRegistrationFailure
    DisplayNameFormatError --> UserKeyInName
    DisplayEmailFormatError --> UserKeyInEmail
    DisplayPasswordFormatError --> UserKeyInPassword
    DisplayPasswordMismatchError --> UserKeyInPasswordConfirmation